#
# ITEM P? S? "Item's description"
# <TAB> TASK "Task's description"
# <TAB> TASK "Task's description"
#
# Priority is from 1 (lowest) to 10 (highest)
# Size is a Fibonacci numbers 1 (easiest), 2, 3, 5, 8 or 13 (most difficult)
#
# One may use P0 and/or S99 if the priority and/or the size has/have not yet decided
#
# In the (near) future when we want to have a front-end for this SCRUM files or
# want to display their contents in our web, we must write a parser for the files.
# So, please ensure that the formatting is correct so that we won't get any problem
# when we want to parse the files later.
#
# regards,
# Aloysius
